SUMMARY:MIDDAY Movement Series and ICA/Boston present: Braiding Futures
LOCATION:ICA\, 25 Harbor Shore Dr\, Boston\, MA 02210
DESCRIPTION:Rough Drafts\, a program of MIDDAY Movement Series\, is a chore
 ographic lab and teaching residency that supports three emerging Boston-ba
 sed artists working in contemporary dance. “Braiding Futures\,” the ar
 tists’ culminating showcase presented at the ICA\, explores the themes o
 f cultural resistance and resilience through contemporary movement practic
 es. This year’s Rough Drafts cycle features artists Mira Göksel\, Aiden
  Marshall\, and Simon Montalvo\, who will each present new and reimagined 
 work developed throughout their residency period.\nhttps://www.icaboston.o
 rg/events/midday-movement-series-and-ica-boston-present-braiding-futures/\
 nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.icaboston.org/events/midday-movement-series-and-ica-boston-
 present-braiding-futures/
END:VEVENT
